WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:03.340
We fly FPV drones.

2
00:00:03.380 --> 00:00:08.750
First-person view: you wear goggles
and see what the drone sees, live.

3
00:00:09.133 --> 00:00:10.693
Start on the simulators.

4
00:00:10.733 --> 00:00:12.733
There are five in the IC room.

5
00:00:12.773 --> 00:00:15.943
Tap your name, fly, and your hours count.

6
00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:17.240
New?

7
00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:21.130
Scan the code on the sim screen
and add your name on the club website.

8
00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:26.790
The Pilot Path takes you from the sims
to real drones, one badge at a time.

9
00:00:27.020 --> 00:00:29.860
Most start with a short video and a quiz.

10
00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:32.870
Some also need a mentor to sign you off.

11
00:00:33.267 --> 00:00:37.947
Your first real flight:
the tiny Meteor 75 Pro.

12
00:00:37.987 --> 00:00:40.797
Then the bigger Pavo 20 Pro.

13
00:00:41.167 --> 00:00:46.137
At the top, you fly at school events
and races, with a spotter beside you.

14
00:00:46.733 --> 00:00:49.223
Add your name, and come fly.

